t (`url`, `farmer_id`, `type`, etc.). Want me to read the code to find it, or do you want to share the schema?\n- **Telugu scope** — should the bilingual format apply to dynamic farmer-entered content too (produce names, descriptions), or only static UI chrome? Farmer-entered text is probably English-only unless you want a translate step.\n\nWant me to proceed? I'll tackle in this order: #3 (quick rename) → #2 (hero) → #4 schema+UI → #6 image upload → #5 Telugu pass (biggest, last)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":586,"cache_read_input_tokens":24225,"output_tokens":941,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":586,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":941,"cache_read_input_tokens":24225,"cache_creation_input_tokens":586,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":586},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaHGZSKiuufDZNEvKsuav","type":"assistant","uuid":"c34d390d-00f4-4ebd-bd8f-d10b5c7580d7","timestamp":"2026-04-21T16:56:54.534Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/veerendra/farmer/yourfamilyfarmer","sessionId":"eb2775c9-1fd3-4173-b50c-698ac924cb4d","version":"2.1.114","gitBranch":"main"}
