g === 'te' ? 'bg-white text-green-800 shadow-sm' : 'text-gray-500'\n        }`}\n      >\n        తె\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n","numLines":29,"startLine":1,"totalLines":29}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b9d49110-0c79-4974-90a5-4e9a4fe813c1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/veerendra/farmer/yourfamilyfarmer","sessionId":"eb2775c9-1fd3-4173-b50c-698ac924cb4d","version":"2.1.114","gitBranch":"main"}
