{"parentUuid":"74ea0065-33b6-45fb-a811-0863845322b6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_017Kv1CKtDD9xGYDvsY4qdTE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All six tasks complete and the production build is green. Here's what you need to do in Supabase, plus what shipped:\n\n## Supabase — run these\n\n```sql\n-- you already have this from #1\nALTER TABLE produce_listings ADD COLUMN description text;\n\n-- NEW for pickup locations\nALTER TABLE farmers ADD COLUMN pickup_locations text[] DEFAULT '{}';\n\n-- NEW for farm image uploads\n-- 1) Create a public Storage bucket named: farm-images\n-- 2) Add a storage RLS policy allowing inserts (anon or authenticated)\n--    Example (permissive — tighten later):\n--    CREATE POLICY \"farm-images insert\" ON storage.objects\n--      FOR INSERT TO anon, authenticated\n--      WITH CHECK (bucket_id = 'farm-images');\n--    CREATE POLICY \"farm-images read\" ON storage.objects\n--      FOR SELECT USING (bucket_id = 'farm-images');\n```\n\n## Code changes\n\n- **Rename**: `neighbourhood` → `local` in `consumer/page.tsx` + `translations.ts`.\n- **Hero**: wrapped in `max-w-3xl mx-auto`, same for search card, chips, lists, demand banner — no more desktop stretch.\n- **Pickup locations**:\n  - Farmer dashboard profile modal has an add/remove chip editor.\n  - Farmer profile produce tab + cart sheet show a dropdown; selection is injected into the WhatsApp pre-fill.\n  - API routes now return `pickup_locations` with the farmer object; cart stores it per-item.\n- **Description column**: already wired on the publish form; now rendered on each `ProduceCard` in the farmer profile.\n- **Image upload** (dashboard → \"Farm photos / పొలం ఫోటోలు\" card):\n  - `<input accept=\"image/*\" capture=\"environment\">` — gallery or rear camera.\n  - Preview before upload, optional caption, upload to `farm-images` bucket, insert into `media` table, gallery refreshes.\n- **Bilingual**: `useLang().tx` is now a Proxy that returns `\"English / Telugu\"` for every key (multi-line templates use `\\n\\n---\\n\\n`). All existing `tx.X` sites became bilingual for free. Manually bilingualized inline literal strings across consumer page, farmer dashboard, login, profile components. `LanguageToggle` is now a no-op.\n\n`npm run build` passes clean."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":328,"cache_read_input_tokens":161777,"output_tokens":846,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":328,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":846,"cache_read_input_tokens":161777,"cache_creation_input_tokens":328,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":328},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaHHs1tv9jURmhXxZrUmZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"c7396f30-3348-40c8-aca0-1e14074c3a9c","timestamp":"2026-04-21T17:14:01.873Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/veerendra/farmer/yourfamilyfarmer","sessionId":"eb2775c9-1fd3-4173-b50c-698ac924cb4d","version":"2.1.114","gitBranch":"main"}
